# Oracle: DIALECT-VACASK §4 (an unnamed analysis is named `<kind><n>`, n its place among the
# deck's analyses; W2301); VD cmd-sweep (a sweep needs a name: `sweep<n>`, W2302); a Dc is its
# axes as sweep lines, outermost first, then an op.
file "generated.ir" deck
  title "generated names"
  analysis op
  analysis tran stop=1m cap=span_over50
  loop sweep (temp) (list values=[0i])
    analysis ac (list values=[1k])
  analysis dc (device_param v2 dc) (list values=[0i, 1i]) (device_param v1 dc) (lin start=1i stop=3i step=0.5)
